# hCA II cluster, reactant complex Zn-OH- + CO2
# B3LYP-D3(BJ)/def2-SVP with RIJCOSX, CPCM with epsilon = 4, cap atoms frozen.
# Fill @ORCA_FIX@ with 00-structure/fill_template.py (0-based atom numbers!)
# and provide reactant.xyz (e.g. copy of 01-xtb-preopt/xtb_reactant/xtbopt.xyz).
# The optimised geometry is written to orca_opt_reactant.xyz.
! B3LYP D3BJ def2-SVP def2/J RIJCOSX CPCM(water) TightSCF Opt Freq

%pal nprocs 16 end
%maxcore 3000

%cpcm
  epsilon 4.0          # overrides the dielectric constant of water
end

%geom
  MaxIter 200
  Constraints
@ORCA_FIX@
  end
end

%freq
  QuasiRRHO true       # ORCA 6: Grimme quasi-RRHO entropy in the thermochemistry
end

* xyzfile 1 1 reactant.xyz
